"states:$($r -join '|')";"rows:$($r0[0].last)|$($r0[0].owner)|$($r0[1].kids)|$($r0[1].cpu)|$($r3[0].last)|$($r0[0].outKB -ge 0)"; "ended:$($e.Count)|$($e[0].owner)|$($e[0].last)"
